bel":"籍贯记载（《世语》）","text":"沛人","evidence":["wudi-q-p145"]},{"id":"wudi-f-p146-wudi-p0389-a7c3e2","label":"籍贯记载（王昶《家诫》）","text":"济阴","evidence":["wudi-q-p146"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"子京","evidence":["wudi-q-p145"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o197-wudi-p0389","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o197"]},{"id":"wudi-m-p145-wudi-p0389","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p145"]},{"id":"wudi-m-p146-wudi-p0389","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p146"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-p117-wudi-p0389","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-p117"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p024-wudi-p0389","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及魏讽","evidence":["wgc-q0107"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p066-wudi-p0389","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及魏讽","evidence":["wgc-q0140"]},{"id":"chengguo-m-39191bf1b36b2ecf08ef","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及魏讽","evidence":["chengguo-q-987a1dde46662f8a381f"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-987a1dde46662f8a381f","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-10ae3325dca8a4b70f04","layer":"original","quote":"昭上疏陈末流之弊曰〖16〗：“凡有天下者，莫不贵尚敦朴忠信之士，深疾虚伪不真之人者，以其毁教乱治，败俗伤化也。近魏讽则伏诛建安之末，曹伟则斩戮黄初之始〖17〗。伏惟前后圣诏，深疾浮伪；欲以破散邪党，常用切齿。而执法之吏，皆畏其权势，莫能纠擿〖18〗；毁坏风俗，侵欲滋甚。窃见当今年少，不复以学问为本，专更以交游为业；国士不以孝悌清修为首，乃以趋势游利为先。合党连群，互相褒叹；以毁訾为罚戮〖19〗，用党誉为爵赏；附己者则叹之盈言，不附者则为作瑕衅〖20〗。至乃相谓：‘今世何忧不度邪？但求人道不勤〖21〗，罗之不博耳〖22〗；又何患其不（知己）〔己知〕矣？但当吞之以药而柔调耳〖23〗。’又闻或有使奴客名作在职家人〖24〗，冒之出入，往来禁奥，交通书疏，有所探问。凡此诸事，皆法之所不取，刑之所不赦；虽讽、伟之罪，无以加也！”","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":363,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-c1436c30e37a4b0fe4ba","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-430c973528d3177269b8","layer":"pei","quote":"魏讽有重名，自卿相以下，皆倾心交之。其后孟达，去刘备归文帝，论者多称有乐毅之量。晔一见讽、达，而皆云必反，卒如其言","attribution":"裴注·《傅子》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":337,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43fe528d6d712a8373fe","start":16,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-581b101be0243db9d787","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b98fdf30cfe006001885","layer":"original","quote":"魏讽等谋反，中尉杨俊左迁","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-p117","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-6a36aaa66b4185d494c7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《傅子》曰：“巽字公悌。瓌伟博达，有知人鉴。辟公府，拜尚书郎。后客荆州，以说刘琮之功，赐爵关内侯。文帝时为侍中，太和中卒。巽在荆州，目庞统为‘半英雄’，证裴潜终以清行显。统遂附刘备，见待次于诸葛亮；潜位至尚书令，并有名德。及在魏朝，魏讽以才智闻；巽谓之必反，卒如其言。”巽弟子嘏，别有传。","attribution":"《傅子》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":497,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aad7859d6d1ec44f2250","start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-c5b29bf051af869a2a60","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-8e714b1b44cb4124bc11","layer":"pei","quote":"其子与魏讽谋反，伏诛","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6e061d17c41e082c2651","start":18,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-d39173ec2c5e106e783d","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-8e714b1b44cb4124bc11","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞宋仲子，后在魏。《魏略》曰：“其子与魏讽谋反，伏诛。魏太子答王朗书曰：‘昔石厚与州吁游，父碏知其与乱；韩子昵田苏，穆子知其好仁。故君子游必有方，居必就士，诚有以也。嗟乎！宋忠无石子先识之明，老罹此祸；今虽欲愿行灭亲之诛，立纯臣之节，尚可得邪！’”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6e061d17c41e082c2651","start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-12db161de380bb62351a","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-007e4689fc337aef8b98","layer":"original","quote":"子泉嗣。坐与魏讽谋反，诛。国除","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":256,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-e-o008b-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，羽率众攻曹仁于樊。曹公遣于禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水泛溢，禁所督七军皆没；禁降羽，羽又斩将军庞德〖2〗；梁、郏、陆浑群盗或遥受羽印号〖3〗，为之支党。羽威震华夏〖4〗，","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-ca8e4a8dd9b29a576654","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-b5253083967b499636ae","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十四年，刘备将关羽围樊、襄阳","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-45b0aacbba69dbd57302","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-76f360b0363911f34631","layer":"original","quote":"立而不跪。羽谓曰：“卿兄在汉中。我欲以卿为将，不早降何为？”德骂羽曰：“竖子，何谓降也！魏王带甲百万，威振天下。汝刘备庸才耳，岂能敌邪？我宁为国家鬼，不为贼将也！”遂为羽所杀","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-4ef32b63a7f5ff4d8c5b","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-600ec9e048958a94c35d","layer":"original","quote":"德常曰：“我受国恩，义在效死〖4〗。我欲身自击羽。今年我不杀羽，羽当杀我","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":94,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-56bae898459683465bc1","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-600ec9e048958a94c35d","layer":"original","quote":"遂南屯樊，讨关羽","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":63,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-66c8264ad0149c8289af","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-cc028a9b73eabe99bd16","layer":"original","quote":"仁使德屯樊北十里","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ae7afaab0329f7bde126","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-cc028a9b73eabe99bd16","layer":"original","quote":"将军董衡、部曲将董超等欲降，德皆收斩之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":66,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-d1ff6efce8f94c6690bb","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-cc028a9b73eabe99bd16","layer":"original","quote":"会天霖雨十余日，汉水暴溢；樊下平地五六丈，德与诸将避水，上堤。羽乘船攻之，以大船四面射堤上。德被甲持弓，箭不虚发","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":9,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-d43cbf6f9121717251c4","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-54a51096c7c075758eb4","layer":"original","quote":"德谓督将成何曰：“吾闻良将不怯死以苟免，烈士不毁节以求生；今日，我死日也","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-d5573e7894d8f4ba3e69","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-54a51096c7c075758eb4","layer":"original","quote":"战益怒，气愈壮；而水浸盛，吏士皆降。德与麾下将一人，伍伯二人〖5〗，弯弓傅矢〖6〗，乘小船，欲还仁营；水盛船覆，失弓矢；独抱船覆水中，为羽所得","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-e8c144058b1ba9ddbc2c","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-600ec9e048958a94c35d","layer":"original","quote":"后亲与羽交战，射羽中额","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":132,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ee14036e58a0b89ec583","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-cc028a9b73eabe99bd16","layer":"original","quote":"自平旦力战至日过中，羽攻益急；矢尽，短兵接战","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-c17de50cd573cb817665","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-815c10d656058333ea9b","layer":"original","quote":"粲二子，为魏讽所引〖23〗，诛。后绝","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-d0270cce4abb7b74bfae","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-6f1883dc7a122c6b787b","layer":"original","quote":"魏讽反","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":284,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":3,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0107","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-01db76f800633531c3ca","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》曰：“钦字仲若，谯郡人。父稷，建安中为骑将，有勇力。钦少以名将子材武，见称。魏讽反，钦坐与讽辞语相连；及下狱，掠答数百，当死；太祖以稷故，赦之。太和中，为五营校督，出为牙门将。钦性刚暴无礼，所在倨傲陵上，不奉官法；辄见奏遣，明帝抑之。后复以为淮南牙门将，转为庐江太守、鹰扬将军。王凌奏钦贪残，不宜抚边，求免官治罪，由是征钦还。曹爽以钦乡里，厚养待之，不治钦事。复遣还庐江，加冠军将军，贵宠逾前。钦以故益骄，好自矜伐，以壮勇高人，颇得虚名于三军。曹爽诛后，进钦为前将军，以安其心，后代诸葛诞为扬州刺史。自曹爽之诛，钦常内惧；与诸葛诞相恶，无所与谋。会诞去兵，毌丘俭往，乃阴共结谋。战败走，昼夜间行，追者不及；遂得入吴，孙峻厚待之。钦虽在他国，不能屈节下人，自吕据、朱异等诸大将，皆憎疾之，惟峻常左右之。”","attribution":"魏书","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-768f4d3727cf793bd05b","start":0,"end":355,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0140","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-916e3150373d4079c2cd","layer":"pei","quote":"《博物记》曰：“初，王粲与族兄凯，俱避地荆州。刘表欲以女妻粲，而嫌其形陋而用率；以凯有风貌，乃以妻凯。凯生业，业即刘表外孙也。蔡邕有书近万卷，末年载数车与粲。粲亡后，相国掾魏讽谋反，粲子与焉；既被诛，邕所与书，悉入业。业字长绪。位至谒者仆射。子宏字正宗。司隶校尉。宏，弼之兄也。”","attribution":"博物记","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":629,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fd72bf831660f4aea13e","start":0,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0141","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-89b6d566268a9df60730","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏氏春秋》曰：“文帝既诛粲二子；以业嗣粲。”","attribution":"魏氏春秋","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":630,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fd72bf831660f4aea13e","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0655","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-89b6d566268a9df60730","layer":"pei","quote":"文帝既诛粲二子；以业嗣粲","attribution":"裴注·魏氏春秋","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":630,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fd72bf831660f4aea13e","start":9,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o197b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01554a0b2561dc520574","layer":"original","quote":"遣于禁助曹仁，击关羽。八月，汉水溢，灌禁军，军没。羽获禁，遂围仁。使徐晃救之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o197c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01554a0b2561dc520574","layer":"original","quote":"九月，相国钟繇坐西曹掾魏讽反〖5〗，免。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":55,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p145a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e4a0d67b16a13bcef3b9","layer":"pei","quote":"讽字子京，沛人。有惑众才，倾动邺都。钟繇由是辟焉。","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":437,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a93dabd3293ccd33c98d","start":10,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p145b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e4a0d67b16a13bcef3b9","layer":"pei","quote":"大军未反，讽潜结徒党；又与长乐卫尉陈祎谋袭邺。未及期，祎惧，告之太子。诛讽，坐死者数十人。","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":437,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a93dabd3293ccd33c98d","start":35,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-1e7ae1441471aa22d204","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e7ae1441471aa22d204","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":428,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2589f07b550616f1e63","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o194","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-adb6682558d65fc17e1a","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年春正月〖1〗，仁屠宛，斩音。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":422,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o197","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01554a0b2561dc520574","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，以夫人卞氏为王后〖4〗。遣于禁助曹仁，击关羽。八月，汉水溢，灌禁军，军没。羽获禁，遂围仁。使徐晃救之。九月，相国钟繇坐西曹掾魏讽反〖5〗，免。﹝三﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p145","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e4a0d67b16a13bcef3b9","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《世语》曰：“讽字子京，沛人。有惑众才，倾动邺都。钟繇由是辟焉。大军未反，讽潜结徒党；又与长乐卫尉陈祎谋袭邺。未及期，祎惧，告之太子。诛讽，坐死者数十人。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":437,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a93dabd3293ccd33c98d","start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p146","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-8592d118cf28a92505a3","layer":"pei","quote":"王昶《家诫》曰“济阴魏讽”。而此云沛人，未详。","attribution":"裴松之按语引王昶《家诫》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a93dabd3293ccd33c98d","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o034a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-39b849dfb87fdd3c9c49","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖8〗，关羽围曹仁于襄阳；曹公遣左将军于禁救之〖9〗。会汉水暴起，羽以舟兵尽虏禁等步骑三万，送江陵，惟城未拔。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o060b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-4b69b4fde2ac4ee74852","layer":"original","quote":"时关羽攻曹公将曹仁，擒于禁于樊。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o026b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-b487aba048617fe0bc2c","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十四年，太祖在长安，使曹仁讨关羽于樊，又遣禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水溢，平地水数丈，禁等七军皆没。禁与诸将登高望水，无所回避。羽乘大船就攻禁等，禁遂降；惟庞德不屈节而死。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-19aaabbe17e3ea3f493a","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-c737aca8a382b78be5fb","layer":"original","quote":"数年，坐西曹掾魏讽谋反〖18〗，策罢就第","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":107,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
